{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-lbyure",
  "id": "source-41000",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41000001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区，手办商店。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "外面已经没有声音，差不多是时候了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "你准备好了吗，能美·库特莉亚芙卡队员？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "准，准备好了！Yes,sir的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "嗯，那么今晚的侦查行动现在开始。Mission start！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "两人脚步声在安静的店铺里回响。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼……没想到会在盒子里醒来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "不知道今天能找到其他同伴吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "唔，这已经是最后一个货架区域，如果依旧没有线索，看样子就得前往店外了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000010",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪嚓——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "那边有声音？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "恭介学长，我过去看看！我现在这样也跑得很快的说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "喂，能美，等——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "小心头顶——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪嚓——轰——噼里啪啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "有什么东西砸破玻璃从窗外飞了进来，激起一阵烟尘。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "咳咳，咳！喂，能美，醒醒，你没事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "……哇……哇呼……恭介学长……？怎么你头上有天使在飞？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "啊，天使们在向我招手的说……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "走……走马灯吗？喂，振作点，不要跟着天使走啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41000021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
